{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"argv": ["tools/origin", "task", "new", "--goal", "Test whether the incumbents a prior-art screen named actually do what each killed candidate's distinguishing requirement asks", "--rationale", "Prior art is the plurality kill reason in the record (10 of 18, F044) and every one of the twelve sealed-report candidates died on it, yet the record's own honest limitations say no need has been shown to be served by the incumbents a screen names, and E020's H2 is not evaluable. E016 measured whether prior art EXISTS; nobody has measured whether it FITS the clause's distinguishing attribute. E016's own note on the atomic-distro row says the recovery was 'of the category, not of the clause's distinguishing attribute', and E024's rows.json shows three sealed-report prior-art deaths (A2, C1, C3) that name no artifact at all.", "--verify", "python3 -m unittest discover -s EXPERIMENTS/028-incumbent-fit -p 'test_*.py' -t EXPERIMENTS/028-incumbent-fit && tools/origin doc lint", "--steps", "Declare the protocol, gates and population before any label is produced", "--steps", "Build the population from E024 rows.json and E016 attributions.jsonl; record for each prior-art death its requirement text and the incumbents a screen named", "--steps", "Fetch each named incumbent's own published documentation into raw/ and record HTTP status per fetch", "--steps", "Two blind readers label each pairing category_only / attribute / partial / unreadable, with no access to the other reader's labels or to the screen's verdict", "--steps", "Calibrate a lexical attribute-match index against deliberately mismatched control pairings, and against the rows E016 already declared served beyond argument", "--steps", "Compute Cohen kappa on the four-category scheme, Wilson intervals, and the declared gate", "--steps", "Record F048, D060 if a decision follows, and update STATE-next-actions item 0 and 0d", "--acceptance", "Every prior-art death in the population is either labelled by two readers or carries a stated reason it could not be, and the gate reports one of three answers including not_evaluated", "--preconditions", "No new population is harvested; the two existing captures are read-only inputs", "--rollback", "The experiment is additive; delete the directory and the finding if it fails"], "cwd": "/home/ubuntu/think-free", "duration_ms": 1602, "exit_code": 0, "log": "sessions/2026-10-05-017-e028-test-whether-the-incumbents-a-prior/commands.log", "log_line_end": 19, "log_line_start": 12, "redactions": [], "summary": "$ tools/origin task new --goal Test whether the incumbents a prior-art screen named actually do what each killed candidate's distinguishing re"}, "duration_ms": 1602, "exit_code": 0, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "command", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 4, "session": "2026-10-05-017-e028-test-whether-the-incumbents-a-prior", "ts": "2026-10-05T18:34:38+00:00"}
